SUMMARY:The Fisherman
DTSTART:20260723T000000Z
DTEND:20260723T020500Z
DTSTAMP:20260723T000000Z
UID:o8j8cPGlp0
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 108 mins (1h48m)\n\nThe Popcorn ListIn this Venice F
 ilm Festival-winning feast of magical realist comedy — aging Ghanaian At
 ta Oko sets his sights on finally having his own boat and becoming the env
 y of his village\, he’ll just need help from a dead talking fish.\n\nhtt
 ps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/the-popcorn-list/the-fisherman\n\nEs
 timated start: 17:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
