UID:O7orESIWqt
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 107 mins (1h47m)\n\nThe Popcorn ListA cursed young w
 oman sets out on a wild fundraising adventure through Trashtown\, USA\, af
 ter she’s told by multiple psychics that she can break the curse by payi
 ng them $1000.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/the-popcorn-lis
 t/fucktoys\n\nEstimated start: 19:45
